---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /gallery/
title: "Tree Work Gallery | Vertic Tree Works Baton Rouge"
description: "Photos of real Vertic Tree Works jobs around Baton Rouge — removals, trimming, stump grinding, storm cleanup, and land clearing."
crumbs: [["Gallery"]]
---
{% from "macros.njk" import ctaBand with context %}
{# Categories per the 2026-09-29 brief. Until Landon approves photo picks, each
   category shows a labeled placeholder slot with descriptive alt text. Never:
   bucket truck / chipper shots, the CNI-lettered dump truck, or Strata fence photos. #}
{% set cats = [
  ["removal","Removal","Excavator taking down a tree in a Baton Rouge yard"],
  ["trimming","Trimming","Climber pruning limbs back from a roofline"],
  ["stump","Stump grinding","Stump ground below grade, area raked clean"],
  ["storm","Storm","Storm-downed tree being cut off a driveway"],
  ["cleanup","Cleanup","Skid steer loading brush and wood for haul-off"],
  ["land-clearing","Land clearing","Lot cleared of brush and small trees, keeper trees left standing"]
] %}
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Our work</h1>
    <p class="lede">Real jobs. No stock photos. We cut, chip, and haul — and leave the yard clean.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if not site.photos.length %}
    <div class="empty">
      <h2>Job photos are on the way</h2>
      <p>We’re adding photos from our own jobs as we go — no stock images. Want to see recent work now? Call or text <a href="{{ site.phone | tel }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> and we’ll send you some.</p>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    {% for c in cats %}
      {% set shots = site.photos | byCategory(c[0]) %}
      {% if shots.length %}
      <h2>{{ c[1] }}</h2>
      <div class="gallery">{% for p in shots %}<img src="{{ p.src }}" alt="{{ p.alt }}" loading="lazy">{% endfor %}</div>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{{ ctaBand("Want your yard to be next?", "") }}
